13
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:04,980
These three chemical reactions are formed and that chemical reaction produces heat and light.

14
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:06,980
It is called fire.

15
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:08,980
So let's know what are the elements of fire.

16
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:13,980
So first of all the elements of fire are fuel, oxygen and then there is heat.

17
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:16,980
But we have to understand one thing that is very important.

18
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:24,980
For example there is a room in which we kept fuel in one corner, oxygen in the other corner and heat in the third corner.

19
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:31,980
So this means that these elements of fire are in one room and if there is fire then the answer will not come.

20
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:33,980
Because these elements are different.

21
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:39,980
So this means that until these three elements are combined, the fire will not start.

22
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:44,980
And after this combination, until there is a chemical reaction like we saw in the definition,

23
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:46,980
until there is a chemical reaction like we saw in the definition,

24
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:48,980
the fire will not start.

25
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:51,980
So the fourth point that will be added in this is chain reactions.

26
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:55,980
That means the reactions that will be in these three are called chain reactions.

27
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:58,980
Until there is a chemical reaction, the fire will not start.

28
00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:02,980
That means there will be four factors in the elements of fire.

29
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:07,980
That will be fuel, heat, oxygen and finally chain reaction.

30
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:10,980
So now let's know what is fire triangle.

31
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:14,980
So what happens in fire triangle is that as we saw earlier what are the elements of fire.

32
00:02:14,980 --> 00:02:16,980
What were they? They were three elements.

33
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:18,980
They were fuel, oxygen and heat.

34
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:27,980
Now if these three elements are combined, then the chain reactions that will be formed are called fire triangle.

35
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:29,980
That means what will be the fire triangle?

36
00:02:29,980 --> 00:02:34,980
Fuel plus oxygen plus heat plus chain reactions.

37
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:39,980
When these four elements are combined then fire will occur and then fire will be called fire triangle.

38
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:44,980
You have to keep in mind that now fire triangle is called fire tetrahedron.

39
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:48,980
Because earlier there were three components in the fire triangle.

40
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:50,980
