00:30:28,930 --> 00:30:30,930
so at that time

732
00:30:30,930 --> 00:30:32,930
it is very important to know

733
00:30:32,930 --> 00:30:34,930
the compliance of the rescue procedure

734
00:30:34,930 --> 00:30:36,930
so let us see

735
00:30:36,930 --> 00:30:38,930
what are the thousands of Confine Space

736
00:30:38,930 --> 00:30:40,930
so the first thousand is

737
00:30:40,930 --> 00:30:42,930
presence of toxic gases

738
00:30:42,930 --> 00:30:44,930
