741
00:30:48,930 --> 00:30:50,930
i.e. in Confine Space

742
00:30:50,930 --> 00:30:52,930
fire and explosion can also be there

743
00:30:52,930 --> 00:30:54,930
that is also a thousand

744
00:30:54,930 --> 00:30:56,930
third is poor ventilations

