755
00:31:16,930 --> 00:31:18,930
i.e. that is also a thousand

756
00:31:18,930 --> 00:31:20,930
then is oxygen deficiency

757
00:31:20,930 --> 00:31:22,930
as soon as you go to Confine Space

758
00:31:22,930 --> 00:31:24,930
