00:31:34,930 --> 00:31:36,930
can also be increased

765
00:31:36,930 --> 00:31:38,930
then comes improper access or egress

766
00:31:38,930 --> 00:31:40,930
i.e. as soon as you go to work in Confine Space

767
00:31:40,930 --> 00:31:42,930
then there are very limited

768
00:31:42,930 --> 00:31:44,930
