769
00:31:44,930 --> 00:31:46,930
so that is also a thousand

770
00:31:46,930 --> 00:31:48,930
after that is suffocation

771
00:31:48,930 --> 00:31:50,930
i.e. due to not having natural air

772
00:31:50,930 --> 00:31:52,930
you can also have suffocation

773
00:31:52,930 --> 00:31:54,930
then there is extreme temperature

774
00:31:54,930 --> 00:31:56,930
i.e. there can be a lot of temperature

775
00:31:56,930 --> 00:31:58,930
i.e. there can be a lot of temperature

776
00:31:58,930 --> 00:32:00,930
let's talk

777
00:32:00,930 --> 00:32:02,930
that whenever you want to work in Confine Space

778
00:32:02,930 --> 00:32:04,930
then it is very important to take

779
00:32:04,930 --> 00:32:06,930
precautions

