00:33:32,930 --> 00:33:34,930
first aid kit

824
00:33:34,930 --> 00:33:36,930
all these emergency

825
00:33:36,930 --> 00:33:38,930
equipment should be available there

826
00:33:38,930 --> 00:33:42,620
after that

827
00:33:42,620 --> 00:33:44,620
the question can be asked

